@startuml ClipboardBridge
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
' purpose: native Codex text copy and image paste across the sbx boundary
'
' Observed 2026-11-09: Codex 0.167.0 used the native Wayland clipboard.
' /usr/local/bin/clipboard-bridge identified itself in Go build metadata as
' github.com/dvdksn/clipboardbridge v0.1.0, revision 9fdd7ed5cd1b.
' The bridge accepted create_data_source and set_selection but ignored writes.
' Codex accepted native success and skipped its local OSC 52 fallback.
' Text paste over the terminal and image reads used different paths.
'
' The upstream fix ships in clipboardbridge v0.3.0 and remains in v0.3.1.
' It requests UTF-8 plain text through source.send, then posts to the existing
' host clipboard-write endpoint. It forwards SBX_HOST_SESSION_ID, prefers plain
' text over HTML, caps copies at 1 MiB and bounds transfers at five seconds.
' It keeps image/png reads and does not expose host clipboard text for reading.
'
' Controlled verification used the released amd64 binaries against an isolated
' HTTP endpoint and a Wayland client. The host clipboard was not touched:
'   v0.1.0: image paste passed; native text copy was silently ignored.
'   v0.3.1: image paste and native text copy passed; session_id round-tripped.
' Release asset clipboard-bridge-linux-amd64, v0.3.1, SHA256:
'   062a6814730904dfb38f217a3e02766abf31bff53bc4e288a678321c40e97bb7
' The release checksum matched before executing the downloaded binary.
'
' Session repair: replace the agent-owned bridge process at its existing
' WAYLAND_DISPLAY socket with the verified v0.3.1 binary and current attach's
' SBX_HOST_SESSION_ID. Keep the image's original binary for rollback.
' This process replacement lasts only for the current sandbox lifetime.
' A real copy followed by paste into a host application confirms delivery.
'
' Durable fix: upgrade host sbx to v0.51.0 or later, enable the host setting
' `sbx settings set clipboard.textCopy true`, and restart the sandbox.
' Check the running bridge version if an older sandbox still shows the bug.
' Do not remove a sandbox merely to refresh helpers before carrying work home.
'
' Sources:
' https://github.com/docker/sbx-releases/issues/646
' https://github.com/docker/sbx-releases/releases/tag/v0.51.0
' https://github.com/docker/clipboardbridge/pull/4
' https://github.com/docker/clipboardbridge/releases/tag/v0.3.0
' https://github.com/docker/clipboardbridge/blob/v0.3.1/README.md
' https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/rust-v0.167.0/codex-rs/tui/src/clipboard_copy.rs

title Codex clipboard — native copy and image paste

component "Codex TUI\narboard / wl-clipboard-rs" as CODEX
component "clipboard-bridge >= v0.3.0\nWayland data control" as BRIDGE
component "sbx host proxy\nclipboard / clipboard-write" as PROXY
component "Host clipboard" as CLIPBOARD

CODEX --> BRIDGE : native text copy
BRIDGE --> PROXY : text + session_id
PROXY --> CLIPBOARD : clipboard.textCopy permits write
CLIPBOARD --> PROXY : image/png
PROXY --> BRIDGE : clipboard.imagePaste permits read
BRIDGE --> CODEX : image paste

note bottom of BRIDGE
  v0.1.0 ignored native text writes.
  v0.3.0 adds the missing write path.
  Image paste remains a separate operation.
end note
@enduml
